| 0 | 0 | S | a | 0 | 0 | $ b S a  |
| 1 | 0 | a | a | 1 | -1 | $ b S  |
| 2 | 1 | S | a | 0 | 0 | $ b b S a  |
| 3 | 1 | a | a | 1 | -1 | $ b b S  |
| 4 | 2 | S | b | 0 | 1 | $ b b  |
